0
//------------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Timers
// When the boss appears and when the boss zone closes and opens.
//   Boss appears after (seconds): Seconds between the last egg dying and Selupan being called.
//   Boss zone closes after (seconds): Seconds after the boss battle starts before the boss zone closes.
//   Boss zone opens after (seconds): Seconds the boss zone stays closed before it opens again (shown to players in minutes).
//------------------------------------------------------------
//  AppearanceDelay    BossZoneCloseDelay    BossZoneOpenDelay
//------------------------------------------------------------
    5                  300                   21600
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Eggs
// The number of boss eggs (1 to 15).
//   Egg count, half: When this many eggs or fewer are left, the server warns that half of the eggs are gone.
//   Egg count, maximum: The most eggs the boss zone can have at the same time.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~15]         [1~15]
//  BossEggHalf    BossEggMax
//----------------------------------------------------------
    5              15
end

2
//-----------
// [InMs]
// SkillDelay
//-----------
   1500
end

3
//----------------------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Patterns
// The condition of each of the six boss patterns, from 0 to 100.
//   Pattern 1 condition (%): Selupan switches to attack pattern 1 when its life is at or below this percentage.
//   Pattern 2 condition (%): Selupan switches to attack pattern 2 when its life is at or below this percentage.
//   Pattern 3 condition (%): Selupan switches to attack pattern 3 when its life is at or below this percentage.
//   Pattern 4 condition (%): Selupan switches to attack pattern 4 when its life is at or below this percentage.
//   Pattern 5 condition (%): Selupan switches to attack pattern 5 when its life is at or below this percentage.
//   Pattern 6 condition (%): Selupan switches to attack pattern 6 when its life is at or below this percentage.
//----------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~100]     [0~100]     [0~100]     [0~100]     [0~100]     [0~100]
//  Pattern1    Pattern2    Pattern3    Pattern4    Pattern5    Pattern6
//----------------------------------------------------------------------
    80          60          50          40          20          10
end